00:00:03,896 --> 00:00:28,116
听：Yang’s ambition was to get an architect’s certificate or become a bowling master. But when he was conducting experiments with a microscope in the basement, a tank on the bench exploded, sending him flying outwards through the exit. He was out of breath while knowing he lost his eyesight as well as 70% of his hearing.

